  "prefLabel": "Hedc 301.01 Career Schools Under Commission Jurisdiction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hedc 301.01 Career Schools Under Commission Jurisdiction. These rules shall apply to schools under the higher education commission jurisdiction, including any school undergoing an acquisition, merger, or transfer or sale of assets, except for those career schools identified in RSA 188-G:1, II.\n\nSource. #10520, eff 2-12-14 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Hedc 300); ss by #12644, eff 10-11-18",
